==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Type: Null|115}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Type: Null}}.
*'''Quick Blow''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Quick Attack''' on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Sabrina's Abra|94}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

